  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Quality Education in Solukhumbu, Nepal 2025-2030 (QEPS 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with Himalayan Trust New Zealand to&#xa0;strengthen local education systems in the Everest region of Nepal,&#xa0;by providing teacher training, scholarships, improved&#xa0;school facilities&#xa0;and better coordination with local education authorities. Work is focussed in Solukhumbu District and delivered in partnership with the local Nepali organisation - Himalayan Trust Nepal. An external evaluation will be conducted as part of the programme monitoring.</narrative>
  </description>
